            <characteristic name="Damage" typeId="2780-b560-1641-b9a5">8</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Traits" typeId="1977-0f4d-9e75-2e2d">Each time this weapon makes a natural attack roll of 10, it can make an additional attack roll with this weapon. Subsequent attacks do not themselves generate additional attacks.
In addition, this weapon inflicts Critical Hits on natural attack rolls of 9+, or on a 7+ if the target is a *Dæmon*.</characteristic>
