  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="The Fractures" id="aac0-f9eb-50dc-fb44" hidden="false">
      <description>While there are enemy *Dæmon* or *aberration* units on the battlefield, this unit cannot be *shaken*, and this unit never gains attrition points as a result of *psychic* weapons or invocations.
At the end of any Resolution Phase in which this unit is *shaken*, instead of modifying its characteristics as normal, roll a D5 and add the number of attrition points allocated to this unit. If the total equals the result on the table below, resolve its effect.
&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Roll Result&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Effects&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reign of Confusion&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Until the following Resolution Phase, this unit halves its Speed characteristic.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Melancholia&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Until the following Resolution Phase, this unit cannot make reactions.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Withering&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Until the following Resolution Phase, subtract 1 from this unit’s Defence characteristics and attack rolls.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Shadows of Forgotten Foes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;This unit immediately moves, ending its move as close as possible to the nearest non-Castellan Legion unit. If it ends its move in control range of that unit it counts as having made a successful charge against that unit, and makes a Fight action targeting them.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;10+&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Losing The Final Battle&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;This unit is immediately destroyed, without triggering its Explosive End ability. Friendly visible Castellan Legion units within 12” of a unit that loses its final battle gain one attrition point.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="Explosive End (3”)" id="0c4e-ec46-1e44-e9dd" hidden="false">
      <description>When this unit is destroyed, before removing the model, roll a dice. On a 5+, it explodes in a *blast* attack, with a 3” radius originating from its base, with a strength of +3 and a damage of 1. This attack has no effect on friendly units.</description>
    </rule>
    <rule name="The Ruin of Angels" id="a410-deda-4b20-8aa4" hidden="false">
      <description>At the end of any Resolution Phase in which this unit is *shaken*, its characteristics are not modified as normal, and instead its controlling player rolls a D5. If the result is greater than the number of attrition points, or if there are any visible enemy *Dæmon* units within 12” of this unit, this unit shakes off the effects and nothing further happens.
If the result is equal to or less than the number of attrition points allocated to this unit, roll a dice and resolve the corresponding effect below:&lt;table&gt;
  &lt;thead&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;th&gt;Roll Result&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th&gt;Effects&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
  &lt;/thead&gt;
  &lt;tbody&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fading Radiance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Until the end of the following Resolution Phase, psychic attacks against this unit have advantage.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Haunted Soul&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;This unit doubles the number of attrition points allocated to it.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Heart of Damnation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;This unit immediately loses D5 points of health. Units cannot gain attrition points as a result of this effect.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lost in Memories&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Until the end of the following Resolution Phase, subtract 1 from this unit’s Morale characteristic.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Melancholy Spirit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Until the end of the following Resolution Phase, this unit cannot make reactions.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Splintered Aegis&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Until the end of the following Resolution Phase, subtract 1 from this unit’s Defence characteristics.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;7&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;This Endless Quest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Until the end of the following Resolution Phase, this unit does not count as being within control range of objective markers.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;8&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Shadows of Forgotten Foes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;This unit immediately moves, ending its move as close as possible to the nearest non-Castellan Legion unit. If it ends its move in control range of that unit it counts as having made a successful charge against that unit, and makes a Fight action targeting them.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;9&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Withering&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Until the end of the following Resolution Phase, subtract 1 from this unit’s attack rolls.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
    &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;b&gt;Wandering in Shadow&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Until the end of the following Resolution Phase, this unit halves its Speed characteristic.&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;

  &lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
  <sharedSelectionEntryGroups>
